vetica\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"><font color=\"#908858\"><b>Infernostride</b></font></span></font>\n</p><p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font color=\"white\" face=\"Verdana,helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">Demonhide Boots</span></font></p></center></td>\n<td width=\"219\">\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"Verdana,helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">Defense: <font color=\"#4850b8\">78.8-105</font> (varies)</span></font>\n</p><p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"Verdana,helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">(Base Defense: 28-35)<br>Required Level: \n29<br>Required Strength: 20<br>Durability: 12<br><font color=\"#4850b8\">+120-150% \nEnhanced Defense</font>(varies)<br><font color=\"#4850b8\">+15 \nDefense</font><br><font color=\"#4850b8\">20% Faster Run/Walk</font><br><font color=\"#4850b8\">5% Chance To Cast Level 8 Blaze When Struck</font><br><font color=\"#4850b8\">Fire Resist +30%</font><br><font color=\"#4850b8\">10% To Maximum Fire \nResist</font><br><font color=\"#4850b8\">Adds 12-33 Fire Damage</font><br><font color=\"#4850b8\">47-70% Extra Gold From Monsters</font>(varies)<br><font color=\"#4850b8\">+2 To Light Radius</font><br>(Only Spawns In Patch 1.09 or later) \n</span></font></p>\n</td>\n<td width=\"214\">\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"Verdana,helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">방어 \n                            : <font color=\"#4850b8\">78.8-105</font> (varies)</span></font>\n</p><p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"Verdana,helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">(기본방어 \n                            : 28-35)<br>레벨 요구치 : \n29<br>힘 요구치 : 20<br>내구력 : 12<br><font color=\"#4850b8\">+120-150% 방어상승 </font>(varies)<br><font color=\"#4850b8\">+15 방어</font><br><font color=\"#4850b8\">20%매우 빠른 달리기/걷기 속도 증가</font><br><font color=\"#4850b8